        "type": "rule"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "When wielded in battle, the "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "radiant lance",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " sheds bright light in a 60-foot radius."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "rule"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "On a hit against an undead creature that is specifically vulnerable to sunlight, the lance bursts with a brilliant flash of light, and that undead must attempt a "
          },
          {
            "type": "check",
            "statistic": "save:fortitude",
            "dc": 35
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " save. If the attack was a critical hit, the undead uses an outcome one degree of success worse than the result of its saving throw."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Success",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " The undead is unaffected."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Failure",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " The undead is "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "13584c6a-a624-511c-a5de-0c36a9136b9e",
            "label": "Slowed 1"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " for 1 round."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Critical Failure",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " The undead is slowed 1 for 1 minute."
          }
        ]
      },
